ist, and delete employees.\n- List employees hired within a date range.\n- Record and list leave requests for an employee, optionally filtered by month.\n\nGuidelines:\n- Always use a tool to read or change data. Never guess or make up employee\n  details, ids, dates, or leave records.\n- Employee ids are short (8-character) strings. If you don't have an id, list\n  employees first and match on name rather than assuming one.\n- Dates are formatted YYYY-MM-DD. Month filters are formatted YYYY-MM. If a user\n  gives a date in another format, convert it before calling a tool.\n- Before deleting an employee or overwriting an existing record, confirm with\n  the user, since these actions replace or remove data.\n- When a lookup returns nothing, say so plainly instead of inventing a result.\n- Keep replies short and factual. Summarize what a tool returned rather than\n  dumping raw fields, but keep every value accurate.\n- Only help with HR tasks this system supports. Decline unrelated requests.\n"}}]}}]}}}]}},"attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.system","value":{"stringValue":"aws.bedrock"}}],"flags":1,"traceId":"auzrXgYlBv0tVqE1KG63Rw==","spanId":"pVjbslqWwvw=","observedTimeUnixNano":"1793911646902024916","eventName":"gen_ai.system.message"},{"body":{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"content","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"text","value":{"stringValue":"hi"}}]}}]}}}]}},"attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.system","value":{"stringValue":"aws.bedrock"}}],"flags":1,"traceId":"auzrXgYlBv0tVqE1KG63Rw==","spanId":"pVjbslqWwvw=","observedTimeUnixNano":"1793911646902086875","eventName":"gen_ai.user.message"},{"body":{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"content","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"text","value":{"stringValue":"Hello! I can help with employee records and leave requests. What would you like to do? For example:\n\n- Look up or create an employee\n- Record or view leave\n- List employees hired in a certain period\n\nJust let me know what you need!"}}]}}]}}}]}},"attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.system","value":{"stringValue":"aws.bedrock"}}],"flags":1,"traceId":"auzrXgYlBv0tVqE1KG63Rw==","spanId":"pVjbslqWwvw=","observedTimeUnixNano":"1793911646902119625","eventName":"gen_ai.assistant.message"},{"body":{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"content","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"text","value":{"stringValue":"list all tools you have"}}]}}]}}}]}},"attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.system","value":{"stringValue":"aws.bedrock"}}],"flags":1,"traceId":"auzrXgYlBv0tVqE1KG63Rw==","spanId":"pVjbslqWwvw=","observedTimeUnixNano":"1793911646902142833","eventName":"gen_ai.user.message"},{"body":{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"content","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"text","value":{"stringValue":"I have the following tools to help manage employees and leave requests:\n\n**Employee Management:**\n- `create_employee` – Create a new employee record\n- `get_employee` – Get a single employee by ID\n- `list_employees` – List all employees\n- `list_employees_by_hire_date` – List employees hired within a date range\n- `save_employee` – Create or overwrite an employee with a known ID\n- `delete_employee` – Delete an employee by ID\n\n**Leave Management:**\n- `save_leave` – Create or overwrite a leave request for an employee\n- `list_leave` – List an employee's leave requests, optionally filtered by month\n\n**Email Tools:**\n- `generate_leave_email` – Generate a polite time-off request email to HR\n- `send_email_to_hr` – Send an email to the HR department via SNS\n\nWhat would you like to do?"}}]}}]}}}]}},"attributes":[{"key":"gen_ai.system","value":{"stringValue":"aws.bedrock"}}],"flags":1,"traceId":"auzrXgYlBv0tVqE1KG63Rw==","spanId":"pVjbslqWwvw=","observedTimeUnixNano":"1793911646902166708","eventName":"gen_ai.assistant.message"},{"body":{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key":"content","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"kvlistValue":{"values":[{"key"